{"id":"H5477","lemma":"סוּחַ","transliteration":"suach","sayIt":"SU-ach","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Suah","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Asher living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.7.36;\nson of: Zophah (H6690);\nbrother of: Harnepher (H2774), Shual (H7777B), Beri (H1275), Imrah (H3236), Bezer (H1221H), Hod (H1936), Shamma (H8037H), Shilshah (H8030), Ithran (H3506H) and Beera (H0878)\n§ Suah = \"sweeping\"\nan Asherite, son of Zophah","glosses":["suah"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":36,"renderings":{"bsb":"Suah","kjv":"Suah"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 7:36","note":"The sons of Zophah: Suah, Harnepher, Shual, Beri, Imrah,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0878","lemma":"בְּאֵרָא","transliteration":"beera","gloss":"Beera"},{"id":"H1221","lemma":"בֶּ֫צֶר","transliteration":"betser","gloss":"Bezer"},{"id":"H1275","lemma":"בֵּרִי","transliteration":"beri","gloss":"Beri"},{"id":"H1936","lemma":"הוֹד","transliteration":"hod","gloss":"Hod"},{"id":"H2774","lemma":"חַרְנֶ֫פֶר","transliteration":"charnepher","gloss":"Harnepher"},{"id":"H3236","lemma":"יִמְרָה","transliteration":"yimrah","gloss":"Imrah"},{"id":"H3506","lemma":"יִתְרָן","transliteration":"yitran","gloss":"Ithran"},{"id":"H6690","lemma":"צוֹפַח","transliteration":"tsophach","gloss":"Zophah"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}